效果的25%。该效果最多叠加5层。\n 如果自身生命值已满，每次触发可获得2层效果。","unlock":"晋升至精英化阶段3"}]}],"potentials":[{"level":1,"name":"烈火洗枪","description":"战技驱火焚影施加的虚弱效果+5%，灼热脆弱效果+5%，衔火血翼盘桓的持续时间+15秒。"},{"level":2,"name":"巫术嗅觉","description":"敏捷+20，智识+20。"},{"level":3,"name":"荆棘破韧","description":"连携技锥心之棘冷却时间-2秒，锥心之棘和追猎伤害倍率提升至原本的1.3倍，技力恢复量提升至原本的1.15倍。"},{"level":4,"name":"看护之证","description":"终结技猩红坠雨所需的终结技能量-15%。"},{"level":5,"name":"予血同在","description":"天赋血涌苏生效果加强：每层灼热伤害提升效果+6%。"}],"source":{"official":{"itemId":"1280","url":"https://wiki.skland.com/endfield/detail?mainTypeId=1&subTypeId=1&gameEntryId=1280&header=0","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28T09:29:36.005Z"},"mined":{"id":"chr_0033_camille","version":"1.6","slug":"camille"}}},{"id":"chr_0031_mifu","itemId":"1358","name":"弭弗","rarity":6,"profession":"guard","element":"physical","weaponType":"greatsword","mainAttr":"str","subAttr":"will","icon":"./assets/icons/operators/1358.png","base90":{"hp":5495,"atk":315,"str":173,"agi":92,"int":90,"will":119},"exact90":{"hp":5495,"atk":315,"str":173.46349673890222,"agi":92.94256259204712,"int":90.90132547864506,"will":119.25407111298156,"critRate":0.05,"artsLevelFactor":1.45408163265306,"physicalLevelFactor":1.22704081632653,"extra":{"12":3,"15":100,"90":3}},"talentStats":{"str":60},"skills":{"normal":{"name":"剑形拳意","type":"普通攻击","description":"普通攻击：\n对敌人进行至多4段攻击，造成物理伤害。作为主控干员时，重击会造成25点失衡。\n下落攻击：\n处于空中时使用普通攻击，会下落并攻击附近敌人，造成物理伤害。\n处决攻击：\n附近有敌人处于失衡状态时使用普通攻击，将处决该敌人，造成大量物理伤害并恢复一定技力。","segments":[{"id":"normal1","label":"普攻第一段倍率","ratio":[34,37,41,44,47,51,54,57,61,65,70,76],"element":"physical","elementOrigin":"description","kind":"normal"},{"id":"normal2","label":"普攻第二段倍率","ratio":[38,42,46,50,54,57,61,65,69,74,79,86],"element":"physical","elementOrigin":"description","kind":"normal"},{"id":"normal3","label":"普攻第三段倍率","ratio":[61,67,73,79,85,91,97,103,109,116,126,136],"element":"physical","elementOrigin":"description","kind":"normal"},{"id":"normal4","label":"普攻第四段倍率","ratio":[77,84,92,99,107,115,122,130,138,147,159,17